meta {
  name: 05 - SPK Production Order List
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{sap_base_url}}/api/sap_production_order/list
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{sap_token}}
}

headers {
  Host: localhost
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # SPK Production Order List (Inbound Pull / Sync)
  
  Service Pengambil: `App\Services\SpkMasterService`
  Command Scheduler: `php artisan spk:sync` (dijalankan setiap 10 menit tanpa overlapping).
  
  Fungsi:
  - Mengambil daftar Production Order aktif dari SAP.
  - Membandingkan kuantitas rencana (`PlannedQty`), kuantitas selesai (`CompletedQty`), dan status (`Status`).
  - Mencatat setiap delta perubahan ke tabel audit `spk_change_logs`.
  - Memperbarui tabel `spk_masters`.
}
